{"id":"77951782409bcade","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-polynomial-time-verifier.md","title":"Polynomial-Time Verifier","display":"df-polynomial-time-verifier — Polynomial-Time Verifier","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-polynomial-time-verifier","aliases":["28-df-polynomial-time-verifier","Polynomial-Time Verifier"],"display":"df-polynomial-time-verifier — Polynomial-Time Verifier","depends_on":["[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-polynomial-time-verifier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-polynomial-time-verifier</span><span>Polynomial-Time Verifier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-polynomial-time-verifier — Polynomial-Time Verifier"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tup}_2\">\\(\\operatorname{tup}_2\\)</span> 采用同一文件中已经定义的二串编码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}^{\\le m}=\\bigcup_{j=0}^m\\{0,1\\}^j\">\\(\\{0,1\\}^{\\le m}=\\bigcup_{j=0}^m\\{0,1\\}^j\\)</span>；验证器值由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v(\\operatorname{tup}_2(x,w))=1\">\\(v(\\operatorname{tup}_2(x,w))=1\\)</span> 表示接受。</li>\n<li>下文引入语言类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP}_{\\mathrm{ver}}\">\\(\\mathbf{NP}_{\\mathrm{ver}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP}_{\\mathrm{ver}}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\ \\middle|\\\n\\exists v\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\n\\left(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\le c(|x|+2)^a}\\;v(\\operatorname{tup}_2(x,w))=1\\right)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{NP}_{\\mathrm{ver}}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\ \\middle|\\\n\\exists v\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\n\\left(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\le c(|x|+2)^a}\\;v(\\operatorname{tup}_2(x,w))=1\\right)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>未返回串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 的输出均视为不接受；也可把验证器规范化为取值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1\">\\(0,1\\)</span>。原书定义2.1采用恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(|x|)\">\\(p(|x|)\\)</span> 的证据长度，习题2.1说明与至多多项式长度等价；可在证据中加入长度字段后填充。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定义2.1及习题2.1；印刷39、63页；PDF65、89页。陈述与长度变体已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{FP}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]；$\\operatorname{tup}_2$ 采用同一文件中已经定义的二串编码。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tup}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,1\\}^{\\le m}=\\bigcup_{j=0}^m\\{0,1\\}^j","display":false},{"tex":"v(\\operatorname{tup}_2(x,w))=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NP}_{\\mathrm{ver}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NP}_{\\mathrm{ver}}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\ \\middle|\\\n\\exists v\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\n\\left(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\le c(|x|+2)^a}\\;v(\\operatorname{tup}_2(x,w))=1\\right)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"0,1","display":false},{"tex":"p(|x|)","display":false}],"bytes":1359,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"验证器刻画：[[28-df-np-ntm]]、[[28-df-polynomial-time-verifier]]、[[28-thm-np-verifier-characterization]]。"},{"id":"e28d5f73ab0dc209","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7d3975b6f5ca63e6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{NP}$ 与 $\\mathbf{NP}_{\\mathrm{ver}}$ 见 [[28-df-np]]、[[28-df-polynomial-time-verifier]]。"},{"id":"31a056a0868abd94","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["adb92775ec020a0b"]}